{"id":"vod_bf_31107","vodId":"31107","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"食戟之灵第四季","name_cn":"食戟之灵第四季","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-32/c510cdb7819def0d2024a5947ca675f4.jpg"},"summary":"一边在自家的餐馆“幸平”帮忙，一边磨炼料理水平的幸平创真，进入了超级精英料理学校“远月茶寮料理学园”。创真在学园内外与各种各样的料理人相遇并不断成长，但随着薙切蓟就任远月学园的新领袖，状况发生了转变。在新创设的中枢美食机关影响下，无法再自由地制作料理……创真等人反对中枢美食机关的做法，结果却被视作学园的背叛者。　　——之后，他们迎来了二年级升级考试。即使遭人白眼，众人仍然齐心协力突破考试，但中枢美食机关的妨碍并未停止。同伴们终于遭到退学处分的打击！被逼入绝境的创真等人为了打破这一状况，决定与蓟政权下的新远月十杰展开连队食戟。初战取得了压倒性胜利，但决定他们命运的激战才刚刚开始。终于迎来2nd BOUT！究竟创真等人能否夺取十杰之座，拯救同伴呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 14:00:55","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shijizhilingdisiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shijizhilingdisiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shijizhilingdisiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shijizhilingdisiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shijizhilingdisiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shijizhilingdisiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shijizhilingdisiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shijizhilingdisiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shijizhilingdisiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shijizhilingdisiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shijizhilingdisiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shijizhilingdisiji/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:43.260Z"}